-- ============================================================
-- Step 4 – Rajida Holdings company data (run AFTER schema.sql, 02_app_columns.sql and 03_match_file_design.sql).
-- Supabase: SQL Editor > New query > paste the whole file > Run.
-- It REPLACES all business records (products, customers, sales, purchases,
-- service jobs, payments …). Staff log-ins are NOT touched: the 7 staff
-- accounts must already exist in Authentication > Users.
-- Dates are written relative to today (current_date - 20 …), so the data is
-- always "recent" when you run it.
-- Generated 2026-10-31.
-- ============================================================
